```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Staycation Invitation 💕</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd6e7, #fff1f7, #d9f3ff);
      color: #333;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border-radius: 25px;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      position: relative;
    }

    .emoji {
      font-size: 55px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #e75480;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 25px;
      color: #444;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .details {
      background: #fff0f6;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .details p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .budget {
      background: #e9f9ee;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .buttons {
      margin-top: 30px;
      height: 100px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    button {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    #yesBtn {
      background: #e75480;
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(231,84,128,0.3);
    }

    #yesBtn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    #noBtn {
      background: #ddd;
      color: #555;
      position: relative;
    }

    #message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff0f6;
      color: #e75480;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="emoji">🏨✨</div>

    <h1>STAYCATION?</h1>

    <p>
      Guys, let's have a little escape from our usual routine! 🥹
    </p>

    <div class="details">
      <p>📅 <strong>Date:</strong> September 26–27, 2026 (Sat–Sun)</p>
      <p>📍 <strong>Location:</strong> MOA</p>
      <p>💰 <strong>Estimated Budget:</strong> ₱1,000 each</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Why are we doing this? 🥹</h2>

    <p>
      Marami na rin tayong magiging busy soon, so this is a chance for us
      to spend time together before everyone's schedules get even crazier.
      Hindi naman kailangan bongga—ang importante, makapag-bonding,
      makapagkwentuhan, tawanan, at gumawa ng memories together. 💗
    </p>

    <div class="budget">
      💸 <strong>Budget Reminder:</strong><br>
      Estimated ₱1,000 each, kaya mag-ipon na tayo nang konti! 😂
    </div>

    <h2>So... game ba? 👀</h2>

    <div class="buttons">
      <button id="yesBtn">YES! 💗</button>
      <button id="noBtn">NO 😭</button>
    </div>

    <div id="message">
      YAY!!! 🎉💗<br><br>
      See you sa staycation! Mag-ipon na kayo! 😂
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      Made with love & konting pressure 😂
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    const yesBtn = document.getElementById("yesBtn");
    const noBtn = document.getElementById("noBtn");
    const message = document.getElementById("message");

    let noSize = 17;

    yesBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      message.style.display = "block";
      yesBtn.innerHTML = "SEE YOU! 🥳";
      noBtn.style.display = "none";
    });

    noBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      noSize -= 2;

      if (noSize < 5) {
        noSize = 5;
      }

      noBtn.style.fontSize = noSize + "px";
      noBtn.style.padding = Math.max(3, noSize / 2) + "px " +
                            Math.max(5, noSize) + "px";

      noBtn.innerHTML = "NO 😭";
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
```
